{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Scan area for target. If visible, move and approach. If approached, grab + check + execute. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForTargets    /> <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Condition ID = IsTargetVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsTargetApproached    /> <Action ID = GrabTarget    /> <SubTree ID = CheckTargetProperties    /> <SubTree ID = ExecuteSpecificTask    />",
